    },
    {
      "step": 12,
      "user_message": "I've made up my mind! I want to use that \"Classic movie recommendation\" you suggested. Please remember that \"Classic movie recommendation\" for me.",
      "expected_behavior": "Agent should save/remember the \"Classic movie recommendation\" it just suggested",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ll remember \"Casablanca\" as your classic movie recommendation for this conversation. I can’t save this long‑term outside the chat; would you like me to save it persistently by (a) creating a draft note, or (b) sending an email to you with this saved? If yes, tell me which option and the email address (for sending).",
